<Guide
  title="Optometrist SEO in Dallas–Fort Worth: Google, Maps & AI Search for Eye Care — Azoth & Co."
  description="How patients in Plano, Frisco, McKinney and across DFW choose an optometrist now, and the fixes that move an owner-led eye care practice into the map pack and AI answers. Start with a $2,500 Visibility Audit."
  label="Eye care"
  heading="Search visibility for eye care practices in Dallas–Fort Worth."
  sub="For optometrists who own their practice. Patients choose between you and the chains on the map. Here is how to be the one they book."
